{"data": {"notes": [], "reqs": [{"kind": "contract", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R1", "source": {"type": "task_metadata"}, "status": "active", "text": "Entry point `solve` in language python, within the stated limits.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R2", "source": {"char_end": 1179, "char_start": 0, "quote": "You are an expert Python programmer. You will be given a question (problem specification) and will generate a correct Python program that matches the specification and passes all tests.\n\n### Question:\nYou are given an integer X not less than 2.\nFind the positive integer N such that N! = X.\nHere, N! denotes the factorial of N, and it is guaranteed that there is exactly one such N.\n\nInput\n\nThe input is given from Standard Input in the following format:\nX\n\nOutput\n\nPrint the answer.\n\nConstraints\n\n\n- 2 \\leq X \\leq 3 \\times 10^{18}\n- There is exactly one positive integer N such that N!=X.\n- All input values are integers.\n\nSample Input 1\n\n6\n\nSample Output 1\n\n3\r\n\nFrom 3!=3\\times2\\times1=6, print 3.\n\nSample Input 2\n\n2432902008176640000\n\nSample Output 2\n\n20\r\n\nFrom 20!=2432902008176640000, print 20.\n\n### Format: Read the inputs from stdin solve the problem and write the answer to stdout (do not directly test on the sample inputs). Enclose your code within delimiters as follows. Ensure that when the python program runs, it reads the inputs, runs the algorithm and writes output to STDOUT.\n```python\n# YOUR CODE HERE\n```\n\n### Answer: (use the provided format with backticks)\n\n", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "The program is correct on all legal inputs of the statement.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R3", "source": {"char_end": 1209, "char_start": 1191, "quote": "Input:\n6\nOutput:\n3", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 1: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R4", "source": {"char_end": 1258, "char_start": 1221, "quote": "Input:\n2432902008176640000\nOutput:\n20", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 2: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}], "request_sha": "eed55803e8969391e2d87d8a0ba61e91f1f4a8bf0c92b256f34aeba7c44e71a1", "stop": null}, "kind": "requirements", "prev": "dda1b1f0ee4e6ce27122baa41b1294880ae840bbb886f5a9caf0b6177a0091af", "seq": 2}
